Our most popular event returns! Volunteer guides will lead a relaxed two-hour walk through the historic downtown district, sharing stories of the people and buildings that shaped our town.

!! What to expect

The route covers about two miles on paved sidewalks, with frequent stops. We will visit:

* The Old Courthouse (1888)
* The former railway depot
* Merchant Row and its original storefronts
* The Riverside Mill site

!! What to bring

Comfortable shoes, water, and a hat if it is sunny. The tour goes ahead in light rain.

!! Accessibility

Most of the route is step-free. Please mention any access needs when you register and we will do our best to help.
